# Candidates from Election Sources

## Summary
- **Bartlett**: 0 candidates (2026 election has no filed candidates listed in source)
- **Nolanville**: 0 candidates (2026 elections have no filed candidates listed in source)
- **Belton**: 2 candidates (election cancelled due to uncontested seats)
- **Killeen**: 22 candidates (2026 General Election + District 2/3 Special Elections)
- **Total**: 24 candidates

